    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21860" root="شحن" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاحِنٌ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَحَنَ</span>]: see the next
preceding paragraph. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْحُونٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
Also A dog <i>going far in pursuit without catching any prey,</i> or <i>game:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَوَاحِنُ</span>. (L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  And
<i>Bearing enmity</i> [or <i>rancour</i> &amp;c. (see 1, last
sentence,)] towards another: one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ شَاحِنٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَكَ</span> [<i>He is bearing enmity</i> &amp;c. <i>towards thee</i>]. (L.)

